msgid "Unix and Unix-like"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../core/installation/shell-commands.rst:32
msgid "Method 1"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../core/installation/shell-commands.rst:34
msgid ""
"In Unix and Unix-like systems, you can create symbolic links (symlinks) in "
"your ``$HOME/.local/bin/`` directory to the necessary PlatformIO "
"executables. This will allow you to execute ``platformio`` commands from any "
"terminal emulator as long as you're logged in as the user PlatformIO is "
"installed and configured for."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../core/installation/shell-commands.rst:39
msgid ""
"First, if it's not already the case, you should export your ``$HOME/.local/"
